===Leisure and hobbies===
====Vacation====
Qymish people are known vacationers both within and outside of Qym. With winter months particularly cold and snowy, many people travel south to warmer countries, a practice known as [[wikipedia:snowbird (person)|snowbird]] tourism. 

====Video games====
As in the rest of Basis, video games are popular in Qym, particularly among the youth, and many games are developed domestically every year. 

